# Zyro web app (Vite). These are build-time settings: Vite writes them into the JavaScript bundle,
# so they are PUBLIC. Never put a secret here.
#
# Legend: [optional] has a safe default.

# [optional] Where the browser calls the API. Default: the relative path /api/v1, which the Vite dev
# server proxies to the backend (vite.config.ts) and the production nginx serves from the same origin.
# Same-origin keeps the httpOnly refresh cookie working. Set it only to point at another backend origin.
# VITE_API_URL="http://localhost:5000/api/v1"
